  "id": "participants-rights",
  "term": "participants’ rights",
  "definition": "Participants’ rights are the protections and entitlements of people who take part in research, especially their ethical safeguarding in studies that may involve risk. In this packet, protecting these rights is tied to meaningful, ongoing community engagement based on respect, justice, and partnership throughout the research process.",
